  "description": {
   "en": "Mugen High School is a private school where some of the nation's most delinquent students gather. Honor student Daijirou Dounen and his childhood friend Sena Tsutsumi decide to enroll in Mugen High School, a den of evil, for their own purposes. However, it turned out to be a hell far beyond their imaginations!? No money! No connections! No power! All they have is brains and action! A duo of ordinary people aim to be at the top of their delinquent high school!! Reiwa's neo-delinquent manga begins!!",
   "ja": "優等生の道念大二郎とその幼馴染・堤 世那が周囲の忠告を振り切って進学した高校、それは…全国屈指の不良が集う「私立無間高校」！それぞれの目的のため、悪の巣窟に足を踏み入れた二人が見たものは、想像をはるかに超えた地獄だった!? 金なし！！コネなし！！力なし！！"
  },
